@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = replace-with-a-valid-admin-or-assigned-technician-token
@repairId = 1

### Trigger the ready notification when the assigned technician marks the repair ready
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/repairs/{{repairId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Listo para recoger",
  "note": "Pruebas satisfactorias"
}

### Retry the notification if SMTP was unavailable during the status change
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/repairs/{{repairId}}/ready-email
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
